# `mutate --check`: a list's name the rename would rewrite.

[break] list-name-warning-never
rule: A break list whose name the rename's rules would rewrite is warned of.
file: xtask/src/mutate/mod.rs
in: rename_warnings
find: let first = found.first()?;
replace: let first = found.first().filter(|_| false)?;
